============================================================

### DevilSquare::Timing ###
	WarningTime/NotifyTime/EventTime/CloseTime in minutes.

### DevilSquare::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### DevilSquare::ExperienceSettings::Experience ###
	Level 0-6 (MAX_DS_LEVEL) - Rank1-10 experience reward for
	finishing in that placement (1st-10th).

### DevilSquare::MoneySettings::Money ###
	Level 0-6 - Rank1-10 Zen reward for that placement.

### DevilSquare::RewardSettings::Reward ###
	Level 0-6 - WC/WP/GP (WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint) paid for
	clearing that level.
	GensContribution  Gens Family contribution points paid for
	                  clearing that level, 0 = none. Both this and
	                  WC/WP/GP only go to the 1st place (Rank 0)
	                  player, same as the existing WCoin reward.

### DevilSquare::EntryLevelMgDlRf::Square / DevilSquare::EntryLevelStandard::Square ###
	Level 0-6 (MAX_DS_LEVEL) - which Devil Square level this row
	configures. Decides which Devil Square a character can enter based
	on a combined level value: character Level (1-400) + MasterLevel
	(Master Skill Tree level, 0 before the 2nd class change). The two
	tables apply to different class groups:
	  EntryLevelMgDlRf   Magic Gladiator / Dark Lord / Rage Fighter.
	  EntryLevelStandard All other classes.
	MinLevel/MaxLevel  Combined-level range for this Devil Square.
	                   MaxLevel=-1 means no upper bound. See
	                   BloodCastle.xml for the full note on how the
	                   post-2nd-change (level 6 / DS7) bracket works.

### DevilSquare::EntrySettings::Entry ###
	Level            0-6 (MAX_DS_LEVEL) - which Devil Square level this
	                 row configures.
	MaxUser          Maximum characters allowed inside this level's
	                 instance at once. Previously a single global
	                 DevilSquareMaxUser ini key applying to all levels.
	MinAccountLevel  Minimum VIP tier (AccountLevel) required to enter,
	                 -1 = no restriction.
	MinReset/MaxReset  Reset range required to enter. MaxReset=0 means
	                 no upper limit.
	MinMasterReset/MaxMasterReset  Grand Reset (Master Reset) range
	                 required to enter. MaxMasterReset=0 means no upper
	                 limit.

### DevilSquare::DailyEntryLimit ###
	Vip0-3  Maximum number of Devil Square entries per day (any level),
	        per VIP tier (AccountLevel 0-3). Resets at midnight (server
	        local time). -1 = unlimited. Kept in memory only - resets
	        if the server restarts.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

